FC has cardiovascular and resistance equipment, courts, studios, a walking/jogging track, climbing wall, table tennis, and Teqball.","source_url":"https://recreation.ku.edu/ambler-srfc","source_title":"Ambler SRFC","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Controlled-access facility for authorized KU community users; eligible participants must present valid KU or ASRFC photo ID at entry.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
